    "detailed_description": "<h1>MoneyFalls RTX</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MoneyFalls RTX is here, Realtime Reflections, Shadows and Global Illumination to light those coins up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nvidia Gpu required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DirectX 12.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nvidia 4060 base model.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recommended to lower screen resolution in base models.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To play it, Go to the Betas tab in the properties of the game and select &quot;nvidia - Version RTX&quot; as the beta to play.\u00a0\u00a0</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>MoneyFalls is a coin pusher simulator with  accurate physics and stunning graphics with many added items and gadgets that makes the game more challenging.</strong><br><br>MoneyFalls is a growing game that is been updated and will grow with many more addons and new machines, Also there is a VR version that needs just to be updated, Next  RTX and other goodies, Updates will be Free as the game grows.<br><br>Many gadgets and mini games also other machines and challenges to discover yourself.(No images included)<br><br>Top 5 on the world<br><br>Added in version 1.2<br><br>4 More new machines.<br><br>1 New Coin Pusher with new challenges..",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>MoneyFalls is a coin pusher simulator with  accurate physics and stunning graphics with many added items and gadgets that makes the game more challenging.</strong><br><br>MoneyFalls is a growing game that is been updated and will grow with many more addons and new machines, Also there is a VR version that needs just to be updated, Next  RTX and other goodies, Updates will be Free as the game grows.<br><br>Many gadgets and mini games also other machines and challenges to discover yourself.(No images included)<br><br>Top 5 on the world<br><br>Added in version 1.2<br><br>4 More new machines.<br><br>1 New Coin Pusher with new challenges..",
    "short_description": "MoneyFalls is a coin pusher simulator with accurate physics and stunning graphics with many added items and gadgets that makes the game more challenging.Added in version 1.2 new machines and modes. Discover it yourself.",
